flowchart LR
    UI[Vue ATM 前端\nWithdraw/Deposit/Transfer/ChangePassword]
    API[统一 API 封装\natm.js + Result]
    CTRL[Controller Facade\nAuth/Account/TransactionController]
    SVC[TransactionService Facade\n隐藏会话、校验、流水与余额更新]
    TX[Spring AOP Proxy\n@Transactional 事务边界]
    RULE[Template Method 思想\n公共交易骨架 + 类型差异规则]
    ADAPTER[Adapter 兼容层\nsessionId 主契约 + token 旧别名]
    MAP[MyBatis Mapper Proxy\nAccountMapper/TransactionMapper]
    DB[(H2/MySQL\naccount + transaction_record)]

    UI --> API --> CTRL --> SVC
    SVC --> TX --> RULE
    SVC --> ADAPTER
    RULE --> MAP --> DB
